#: inc/options/options-output.php:2144
msgid "We can't guarantee this toolbar editor will work with every possible plugin and theme combination as different developers sometimes don't do things the WordPress way! Therefore support is limited for the toolbar to <strong>general functionality only</strong>. For comprehensive support for your specific environment we recommend checking out the <a href=\"https://northernbeacheswebsites.com.au/custom-admin-interface-pro/\" target=\"_blank\">pro version</a> where we can get things working for your environment and provide a money-back guarantee."
msgstr "我們無法保證這個工具列編輯器可以適用於各種佈景主題及外掛的組合，因為有些佈景主題及外掛並未遵循開發規範。因此，對於工具列僅對<strong>一般功能問題</strong>提供有限度的技術支援。如需針對特定環境提供完整技術支援，請使用 <a href=\"https://northernbeacheswebsites.com.au/custom-admin-interface-pro/\" target=\"_blank\">Pro 版</a>，我們便能針對指定網站環境進行調整，並提供退費保證。"

#: inc/options/options-output.php:1563
msgid "We can't guarantee this menu editor will work with every possible plugin and theme combination as different developers sometimes don't do things the WordPress way! Therefore support is limited for the admin menu to <strong>general functionality only</strong>. For comprehensive support for your specific environment we recommend checking out the <a href=\"https://northernbeacheswebsites.com.au/custom-admin-interface-pro/\" target=\"_blank\">pro version</a> where we can get things working for your environment and provide a money-back guarantee."
msgstr "我們無法保證這個選單編輯器可以適用於各種佈景主題及外掛的組合，因為有些佈景主題及外掛並未遵循開發規範。因此，對於管理選單僅對<strong>一般功能問題</strong>提供有限度的技術支援。如需針對特定環境提供完整技術支援，請使用 <a href=\"https://northernbeacheswebsites.com.au/custom-admin-interface-pro/\" target=\"_blank\">Pro 版</a>，我們便能針對指定網站環境進行調整，並提供退費保證。"

#: inc/options/options-output.php:751
msgid ""
"Before creating support requests, it is important you read the following rules: \n"
"                \n"
"                <ol>\n"
"                    <li>The custom admin menu and custom toolbar have limited support and we can only help you with general issues only. We don't guarantee these features for every possible theme and plugin combination especially when developers set things up in non-compliant ways. So don't ask us: \"how come this doesn't work with this or that\" as I won't be able to help you unfortunately, and not to mention the WordPress.org forum rules don't allow the exchange of login details so we can't diagnose issues on your specific site!</li>\n"
"                    <li><strong>As part of support I do not provide customisation services or code samples.</strong> If you need help with the implementation of the plugin or need to achieve something specific please <a href=\"mailto:info@northernbeacheswebsites.com.au\">email me</a> and I can provide an estimate for the work.</li> \n"
"                    <li>Please include the diagnostic information mentioned below, otherwise I will not bother answering your request.</li>     \n"
"                    <li>Please ensure you are using the latest version of WordPress and the latest version of the plugin, and clear your browser cache.</li>                    \n"
"                </ol>\n"
"\n"
"                Ok now that you have read ALL the rules you can create a support request <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/wp-custom-admin-interface\">here</a>. You can also check out the below video which shows a general walkthrough of the plugin (although it is getting a little dated now).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"在提出技術支援要求前，請閱讀以下重要規則:\n"
"                \n"
"                <ol>\n"
"                    <li>我們對自訂管理後台選單及自訂工具列提供有限度的技術支援，僅針對一般問題提供協助。我們無法保證這些功能可以適用於各種佈景主題及外掛的組合，因為有些佈景主題及外掛並未遵循開發規範。請不要向我們詢問「為什麼這項功能無法與某外掛或佈景主題一起正常運作」，這是我們無法協助並回覆使用者的問題。也請不要在 WordPress.org 的論壇上提及論壇規定不可提及的登入詳細資訊，因此我們無法為你的指定網站診斷任何問題。</li>\n"
"                    <li><strong>進行技術支援時，我們不提供客製化服務或程式碼範例。</strong>如果需要外掛進行改進或需要特定功能，請使用電子郵件<a href=\"mailto:info@northernbeacheswebsites.com.au\">與我們聯絡</a>，我們會提出工作報價。</li> \n"
"                    <li>電子郵件內容請包含以下提及的診斷資訊，否則我不會花費時間回覆任何要求。</li>\n"
"                    <li>請先確定網站使用的是最新版本的 WordPress 及外掛，並請清除瀏覽器快取。</li>\n"
"                </ol>\n"
"\n"
"                了解全部規則後，請前往 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/wp-custom-admin-interface\">WordPress.org 技術支援論壇</a>提出技術支援要求，也可以觀看下方的外掛逐步解說影片 (雖然影片有點過時)。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"                "

