#: inc/options/options-output.php:1117
msgid "There's no need to put in the starting or closing PHP tags. Please be super careful before putting in code here. In fact I really recommend not using this setting and instead putting custom code into your themes functions.php file so you can easily revert any errors caused by the code."
msgstr "不需要將程式碼放在 php 開始或結束標籤間，並且要十分注意在這裡加入的程式碼。這個外掛的開發者建議不要使用這項功能，改為將自訂程式碼插入至目前使用的佈景主題的 functions.php 檔案中，這樣網站管理員便能輕易從程式碼造成的錯誤中復原。"

